<title>ITALY: Gross yields rise at Italian Btp bond auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yields rise at Italian Btp bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for an eleventh tranche of 2.5 trillion lire worth of three-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (Btp) with a 6.00 pct coupon, and a ninth tranche of 3.0 trillion lire of five-year Btps carrying a 6.25 pct coupon.</p>
<p>		  Feb 15, 2000   pvs	March 1, 2002   pvs</p>
<p> Net Yield	 5.89 pct    5.86	  6.16 pct     6.05</p>
<p> Gross Yield     6.67 pct    6.64	  7.02 pct     6.91</p>
<p> Assigned price 98.55	 98.60	 97.35	  97.75</p>
<p> Bids	     5.543 trln lire	   5.768 trln lire</p>
<p> Assigned	 2.500 trln lire	   3.000 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparisons are with a previous auction on April 16.</p>
</text>
